DEFAULT MODELS AND VOICES
-------------------------
Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-da-en
  Danish-to-English Marian translation model
  License: Apache-2.0
  https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-da-en

lucasw89/whisper-small-danish-ct2-int8
  CTranslate2 int8 conversion of thorhojhus/whisper-small-danish, a Danish
  fine-tune of OpenAI Whisper "small"
  License: MIT
  https://huggingface.co/lucasw89/whisper-small-danish-ct2-int8
  https://huggingface.co/thorhojhus/whisper-small-danish

OpenAI Whisper "small"
  Speech recognition model weights
  License: MIT
  https://github.com/openai/whisper

Kokoro-82M
  English speech synthesis model (default TTS)
  License: Apache-2.0
  https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  ONNX packaging: https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx (MIT)

Piper voice en_GB-alba-medium
  English speech synthesis fallback voice from rhasspy/piper-voices
  License: CC BY 4.0
  Dataset: https://datashare.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/3270
  Voice repository: https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices
